{"id":43,"name":"oddish","speciesId":43,"dex":43,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["grass","poison"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":50,"defense":55,"special-attack":75,"special-defense":65,"speed":30},"abilities":[{"name":"chlorophyll","hidden":false},{"name":"run-away","hidden":true}],"height":5,"weight":54,"baseExp":64,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/43.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/43.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/43.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/43.ogg","genus":"Weed Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Erva Daninha","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"During the day, it keeps its face buried in the ground. At night, it wanders around sowing its seeds."},{"version":"yellow","text":"It may be mistaken for a clump of weeds. If you try to yank it out of the ground, it shrieks horribly."},{"version":"gold","text":"Awakened by moon­ light, it roams actively at night. In the day, it stays quietly underground."},{"version":"silver","text":"If exposed to moonlight, it starts to move. It roams far and wide at night to scatter its seeds."},{"version":"crystal","text":"During the day, it stays in the cold underground to avoid the sun. It grows by bath­ ing in moonlight."},{"version":"ruby","text":"During the daytime, ODDISH buries itself in soil to absorb nutrients from the ground using its entire body. The more fertile the soil, the glossier its leaves become."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"ODDISH searches for fertile, nutrient- rich soil, then plants itself. During the daytime, while it is planted, this POKéMON’s feet are thought to change shape and become similar to the roots of trees."},{"version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON grows by absorbing moonlight. During the daytime, it buries itself in t